  "reasoning": "The defendants broke a car window with a slingshot and stole items from the vehicle, which constitutes theft (盗窃罪). Afterwards they drove a car, threw nails from the window, and caused damage to the tires of other vehicles and a police car; this intentional damage to vehicles falls under the crime of destroying transportation means, i.e., 破坏交通工具罪. No other distinct illegal acts are described, so the applicable crimes are theft and destruction of transportation tools.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]盗窃罪;破坏交通工具罪<eoa>"
